        "original_id": "44a280c2-e9f3-555b-b05d-80b210e095fd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: 1982 Georgia Bulldogs football team\n- People: Vince Dooley\n- Organizations: University of Georgia, Penn State\n- Events: 1982 NCAA Division I-A football season, Sugar Bowl\n\nFacts:\n- The 1982 Georgia Bulldogs football team represented the University of Georgia during the 1982 NCAA Division I-A football season.\n- In the 1982 season, head coach Vince Dooley led the top-ranked Georgia Bulldogs football team.\n- In the Sugar Bowl following the 1982 season, the Georgia Bulldogs lost 23-27 to number two Penn State.\n- Vince Dooley was born on September 4, 1932.\n- Vince Dooley served as head football coach at the University of Georgia from 1964 through 1988.\n- Vince Dooley served as athletic director at the University of Georgia from 1979 to 2004.",
